    "expertise": {
        "heading": "we are expert in",
        "background_image_url": "https://grupoedima.com/wp-content/themes/local-business-wordpress-theme/assets/images/weareexpertbg.png",
        "paragraphs": [
            "At Grupo Edima, our expertise combines deep technical mastery of the HOPEX platform with strategic Enterprise Architecture advisory capabilities. We specialize in the installation, customization, migration, and optimization of HOPEX environments, ensuring that the platform is fully aligned with each organization’s governance model and transformation objectives.Our experience spans Business Capability modeling and strategy alignment, IT Portfolio Management, Risk and Compliance (GRC) frameworks, and Business Process design and automation. We support organizations from capability definition and value stream structuring to application rationalization, risk governance, and process optimization initiatives. By integrating technical excellence with architectural vision, we enable enterprises to transform HOPEX into a strategic decision-support platform—connecting business strategy, technology investments, governance controls, and operational execution within a unified and structured ecosystem."
        ],
